+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1024×1024 | 1024×1024 | $0.114 | ₹11.9 | output $0.041 + image input $0.072 (8,942 tok) + text $0.002 | ₹30 |
+| 1280×720 | 1536×1024 | $0.163 | ₹16.9 | output $0.061 + image input $0.100 (12,518 tok) + text $0.002 | ₹30 |
